{
  "$description": "Chart tokens (spec 003, spec 008). Every color aliases tokens/base.tokens.json, so this file copies with the base file alone. Groups that differ by theme hold four sets: standard (on paper, stone 0) and high (on white) for light paper, which every static canvas uses; dark-standard and dark-high (both on stone 950) for an interactive chart on a dark page (DECISIONS/012). Format: W3C DTCG 2025.10.",
