      "$type": "color",
      "$description": "The one series the title is about. mark draws it; label is its direct label, a text-safe step of the same hue (4.5:1 in the standard sets, 7:1 in the high ones). On dark paper both come from the lavender end of the purple ramp, lighter than the accent.",
