      "$type": "color",
      "$description": "Every other series: gray that recedes. mark draws lines, dots and bars; label is a muted direct label; range draws the bar between the dots of a dot-and-range chart, and the zoom slider's data background. It stays under 3:1 in the standard sets, light and dark, so it recedes.",
