    "sequential": {
      "$type": "color",
      "$description": "Magnitude: one hue, on the accent's ramp, seven steps from the lowest value (1) to the highest (7). On light paper the steps run light to dark; on graphite they run dark to light, so in every set a higher value contrasts more with the chart surface. Where a step shares its light hex with another standard or high token, its dark step is that token's dark counterpart (standard 5 and 6, high 7), so the dark map stays unambiguous (DECISIONS/012).",
