      "incomplete": {
        "$description": "An incomplete period: its segment is dashed in the series' own color and width and ends in a hollow point (mark.point, with a 2px ring, mark.ring). On the static canvases the point is an ECharts emptyCircle, which ECharts fills with its own white, #ffffff (color.white), and rings at 2px; the interactive view draws a circle filled with its chart surface (surface) and ringed in the series' color at mark.ring, 2px, in every set, dark ones included. The dash and gap are what ECharts draws for a dashed line, four and two line widths, on the highlight line (mark.line.highlight); static canvases scale them with the line, to 25px and 12.5px",
        "style": {
          "$type": "strokeStyle",
          "$value": "dashed"
        },
        "dash": {
          "$type": "dimension",
          "$value": {
            "value": 10,
            "unit": "px"
          }
        },
        "gap": {
          "$type": "dimension",
          "$value": {
            "value": 5,
            "unit": "px"
          }
        }
